# N3 example: policy.
# Companion to policy.pl/.srl: the producer of :Blocked appears after its
# consumer deliberately. N3 has no stratification concept of its own; its
# negation-as-failure feature (log:notIncludes) is instead handled by
# deferring the negated rule until the ordinary closure saturates.

@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#>.
@prefix : <https://eyereasoner.github.io/eyepl/examples/policy#>.

:alice a :Person.
:bob a :Person.
:carol a :Person.
:alice a :Blocked.
:carol a :Flagged.

{?x a :Flagged} => {?x a :Blocked}.

{?x a :Person. ?SCOPE log:notIncludes {?x a :Blocked}.} => {?x a :Eligible}.
